<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#f7f7f1">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="https://i.ibb.co/gbgLwSqg/Chat-GPT-Image-Jul-26-2026-04-53-23-AM-2.png">
  <meta name="description" content="Daily operations log for the KREJUV FEC Blowdown Tie-In project.">
  <title>KREJUV FEC | Blowdown Tie-In Daily Log</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      color-scheme: light;
      --ink: #183b2d;
      --ink-2: #315343;
      --muted: #748077;
      --line: #e5e8df;
      --paper: #f7f7f1;
      --card: #fffefa;
      --soft: #eef1e8;
      --accent: #b6c1a3;
      --shadow: 0 14px 40px rgba(35, 54, 40, .075);
      --radius-lg: 22px;
      --radius-md: 14px;
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--ink);
      background:
        repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(57, 79, 63, .025) 0 1px, transparent 1px 8px) left top / 50px 100% no-repeat,
        repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(57, 79, 63, .025) 0 1px, transparent 1px 8px) right top / 50px 100% no-repeat,
        var(--paper);
      min-height: 100vh;
    }
    button, input { font: inherit; }
    button { cursor: pointer; }
    a { color: inherit; }
    .page-shell { max-width: 1220px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px 28px 52px; }
    .topbar {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 34px; min-height: 48px;
      padding: 0 2px; margin-bottom: 42px;
    }
    .brand { display: inline-flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: -.03em; }
    .brand-mark {
      display: grid; place-items: center; width: 31px; height: 31px; border-radius: 10px;
      color: #f9f9f3; background: var(--ink); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -.06em;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(24,59,45,.18);
    }
    .brand-text { font-size: 14px; }
    .topnav { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 27px; color: #818981; font-size: 12px; }
    .topnav a { text-decoration: none; }
    .topnav a:hover { color: var(--ink); }
    .topbar-spacer { flex: 1; }
    .source-link, .button-primary, .button-secondary {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px;
      min-height: 39px; padding: 0 15px; border-radius: 999px; text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 12px; font-weight: 650; transition: transform .15s ease, background .15s ease, border-color .15s ease;
    }
    .source-link, .button-secondary { color: var(--ink); background: #fffefa; border: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .button-primary { color: white; background: var(--ink); border: 1px solid var(--ink); }
    .source-link:hover, .button-secondary:hover, .button-primary:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); }
    .button-primary:hover { background: #24513d; }
    .hero { max-width: 840px; margin: 0 auto 30px; text-align: center; }
    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; padding: 7px 12px;
      color: var(--ink-2); background: #f1f3eb; border: 1px solid #e3e8dc;
      border-radius: 999px; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: .09em; text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .eyebrow-dot { width: 6px; height: 6px; background: #6f8a63; border-radius: 50%; box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(111,138,99,.13); }
    h1 {
      margin: 16px 0 9px; color: var(--ink); font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 56px); line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -.055em; font-weight: 500;
    }
    h1 span { display: block; color: #8b978c; }
    .hero-copy { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7; }
    .hero-actions { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; margin-top: 21px; }
    .summary-strip {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 10px; max-width: 800px;
      margin: 27px auto 29px;
    }
    .summary-card {
      min-height: 78px; padding: 14px 17px; text-align: left; background: rgba(255,254,250,.78);
      border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 15px;
    }
    .summary-label { display: block; margin-bottom: 7px; color: #879088; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: .07em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .summary-value { color: var(--ink); font-size: 17px; font-weight: 730; letter-spacing: -.03em; }
    .summary-value.small { font-size: 13px; }
    .workspace {
      overflow: hidden; background: rgba(255,254,250,.92); border: 1px solid #e2e5dc;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg); box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }
    .workspace-top {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 15px; padding: 17px 20px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); background: rgba(250,250,245,.8);
    }
    .workspace-title { min-width: 165px; }
    .workspace-title strong { display: block; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
    .workspace-title span { display: block; margin-top: 3px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 10px; }
    .toolbar-spacer { flex: 1; }
    .search-wrap { position: relative; width: min(300px, 35vw); }
    .search-icon { position: absolute; left: 11px; top: 10px; color: #89948b; pointer-events: none; }
    .search-input {
      width: 100%; height: 36px; padding: 0 12px 0 33px; color: var(--ink); background: #fffefa;
      border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; outline: none; font-size: 11px;
    }
    .search-input:focus, .connect-input:focus { border-color: #9caf9d; box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(85,117,95,.11); }
    .toolbar-button {
      height: 36px; padding: 0 12px; color: var(--ink-2); background: #fffefa;
      border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 650;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .toolbar-button:hover { background: #f5f6f0; border-color: #d5dbcf; }
    .connection-status {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; padding: 8px 10px;
      color: #667268; background: #f4f5ef; border: 1px solid #e7e9e1; border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 10px; white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .status-light { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: #d19a53; }
    .connection-status.connected .status-light { background: #4e9467; }
    .connection-status.error .status-light { background: #bd6258; }
    .log-list { padding: 18px; }
    .day-card {
      margin: 0 0 11px; overflow: hidden; background: #fffefa; border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 15px; transition: border-color .15s ease, box-shadow .15s ease;
    }
    .day-card:hover { border-color: #d8ded3; }
    .day-card[open] { box-shadow: 0 5px 18px rgba(37,55,42,.035); }
    .day-summary {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; min-height: 68px; padding: 12px 15px;
      list-style: none; cursor: pointer;
    }
    .day-summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
    .calendar-icon {
      display: grid; place-items: center; flex: 0 0 39px; height: 39px; border-radius: 12px;
      color: var(--ink); background: #eff2e9; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 750;
    }
    .day-heading { min-width: 0; flex: 1; }
    .day-heading strong { display: block; overflow: hidden; color: var(--ink); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 720; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
    .day-heading span { display: block; margin-top: 4px; color: #879088; font-size: 10px; }
    .day-badge { padding: 6px 9px; color: #667467; background: #f5f6f1; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 650; white-space: nowrap; }
    .chevron { width: 17px; height: 17px; color: #829085; transition: transform .2s ease; }
    details[open] .chevron { transform: rotate(180deg); }
    .day-content { padding: 0 15px 16px 68px; }
    .table-scroll { overflow-x: auto; border: 1px solid #e9ece5; border-radius: 11px; }
    .log-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.5; }
    .log-table th { padding: 9px 11px; color: #68766b; background: #f5f6f0; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: .06em; text-align: left; text-transform: uppercase; white-space: nowrap; }
    .log-table td { min-width: 100px; padding: 10px 11px; color: #435348; border-top: 1px solid #edf0e9; vertical-align: top; white-space: pre-wrap; }
    .log-table td:first-child { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 650; }
    .log-notes { display: grid; gap: 8px; }
    .log-note { position: relative; padding: 11px 13px 11px 15px; color: #435348; background: #f8f9f4; border: 1px solid #ecefe7; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.65; white-space: pre-wrap; }
    .log-note::before { position: absolute; top: 13px; bottom: 13px; left: 0; width: 3px; background: #a9b89d; border-radius: 0 3px 3px 0; content: ""; }
    .empty-state { padding: 44px 22px 48px; text-align: center; }
    .empty-icon { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; margin: 0 auto 13px; color: var(--ink); background: #eef1e8; border-radius: 16px; }
    .empty-state h2 { margin: 0 0 7px; font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; font-size: 23px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -.03em; }
    .empty-state p { max-width: 440px; margin: 0 auto; color: var(--muted); font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.7; }
    .empty-actions { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 17px; }
    .empty-message { margin-top: 12px !important; color: #9a7058 !important; }
    .setup-panel { margin: 0 18px 18px; padding: 16px 17px; background: #f7f8f3; border: 1px solid #e6eae1; border-radius: 13px; }
    .setup-panel summary { color: var(--ink-2); cursor: pointer; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; }
    .setup-panel ol { margin: 12px 0 0; padding-left: 20px; color: #66736a; font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.75; }
    .setup-panel code { padding: 2px 4px; color: #355544; background: #ebeee6; border-radius: 4px; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; font-size: .95em; }
    .footer { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; padding: 14px 20px 17px; color: #899188; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: 9px; }
    .footer a { color: #526b5a; text-decoration: none; }
    dialog {
      width: min(490px, calc(100% - 28px)); padding: 0; color: var(--ink); background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: 0 24px 75px rgba(17,35,24,.22);
    }
    dialog::backdrop { background: rgba(18,37,27,.38); backdrop-filter: blur(3px); }
    .dialog-inner { padding: 22px; }
    .dialog-head { display: flex; align-items: start; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .dialog-head h2 { margin: 0; font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; font-size: 23px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -.03em; }
    .dialog-head p { margin: 5px 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.6; }
    .dialog-close { margin-left: auto; width: 31px; height: 31px; color: #6f7b72; background: #f2f4ed; border: 0; border-radius: 9px; font-size: 17px; }
    .field-label { display: block; margin-bottom: 6px; color: #59685d; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; }
    .connect-input { width: 100%; height: 40px; padding: 0 11px; color: var(--ink); background: white; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; outline: 0; font-size: 11px; }
    .field-help { margin: 7px 0 14px; color: #818b83; font-size: 9px; line-height: 1.55; }
    .dialog-actions { display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 8px; margin-top: 17px; }
    .dialog-note { margin: 0 0 13px; padding: 10px 11px; color: #735b43; background: #faf5ed; border: 1px solid #efe4d3; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 9px; line-height: 1.6; }
    .toast { position: fixed; right: 20px; bottom: 20px; z-index: 10; max-width: 340px; padding: 11px 14px; color: white; background: var(--ink); border-radius: 11px; box-shadow: var(--shadow); font-size: 11px; opacity: 0; transform: translateY(8px); pointer-events: none; transition: .2s ease; }
    .toast.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    .hidden { display: none !important; }
    @media (max-width: 760px) {
      .page-shell { padding: 17px 15px 32px; }
      .topbar { gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 31px; }
      .topnav { display: none; }
      .source-link { min-height: 35px; padding: 0 11px; font-size: 10px; }
      .hero { margin-bottom: 23px; }
      .summary-strip { gap: 7px; margin: 22px auto; }
      .summary-card { min-height: 69px; padding: 11px 10px; }
      .summary-value { font-size: 15px; }
      .summary-value.small { font-size: 11px; }
      .workspace-top { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 9px; padding: 14px; }
      .workspace-title { flex: 1; }
      .toolbar-spacer { display: none; }
      .search-wrap { order: 3; width: 100%; }
      .toolbar-button { flex: 1; }
      .connection-status { padding: 7px 8px; }
      .log-list { padding: 11px; }
      .day-summary { gap: 10px; min-height: 62px; padding: 10px; }
      .day-content { padding: 0 10px 12px; }
      .footer { flex-direction: column; padding: 13px 15px; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 430px) {
      h1 { font-size: 35px; }
      .summary-strip { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
      .summary-label { font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: .04em; }
      .summary-value.small { font-size: 10px; }
      .day-badge { display: none; }
      .empty-state { padding: 34px 17px; }
      .hero-actions .button-secondary { display: none; }
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *, *::before, *::after { scroll-behavior: auto !important; transition-duration: .01ms !important; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page-shell">
    <header class="topbar">
      <a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="KREJUV FEC daily log home">
        <span class="brand-mark">KF</span><span class="brand-text">KREJUV FEC</span>
      </a>
      <nav class="topnav" aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="#daily-log">Daily log</a>
        <a href="#connection">Connection</a>
      </nav>
      <span class="topbar-spacer"></span>
      <a class="source-link" href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1XAyrsD9GLGaY3ZnaiWnND25iF3DsvKR_rhKFXkcffmQ/edit?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Open source sheet <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
    </header>

    <main id="top">
      <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="page-title">
        <div class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span> Project operations log</div>
        <h1 id="page-title">KREJUV FEC<span>BLOWDOWN TIE-IN</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-copy">A clear, day-by-day record of field activities, progress and follow-up actions.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button-primary" href="#daily-log">View daily log <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
          <button class="button-secondary" id="connectTopButton" type="button">Connect Google Sheet</button>
        </div>
        <div class="summary-strip" aria-label="Daily log summary">
          <div class="summary-card"><span class="summary-label">Log days</span><strong class="summary-value" id="dayCount">—</strong></div>
          <div class="summary-card"><span class="summary-label">Latest day</span><strong class="summary-value small" id="latestDay">Waiting for sheet</strong></div>
          <div class="summary-card"><span class="summary-label">Connection</span><strong class="summary-value small" id="connectionSummary">Not connected</strong></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="workspace" id="daily-log" aria-label="Daily activity log">
        <div class="workspace-top">
          <div class="workspace-title"><strong>Daily activity</strong><span id="lastUpdated">Connect the source sheet to load daily tabs</span></div>
          <div class="toolbar-spacer"></div>
          <div class="connection-status" id="statusPill" aria-live="polite"><span class="status-light"></span><span id="statusText">Not connected</span></div>
          <button class="toolbar-button" id="refreshButton" type="button" title="Refresh data from Google Sheets">↻ Refresh</button>
          <div class="search-wrap">
            <svg class="search-icon" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="m16 16 4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
            <input class="search-input" id="searchInput" type="search" placeholder="Search dates and activities…" aria-label="Search daily log">
          </div>
          <button class="toolbar-button" id="expandButton" type="button">Collapse all</button>
        </div>
        <div class="log-list" id="logList">
          <div class="empty-state" id="emptyState">
            <div class="empty-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="4" y="5" width="16" height="15" rx="2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M8 3v4M16 3v4M4 9h16M8 13h3M8 16h6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h2 id="emptyTitle">Connect your daily log</h2>
            <p id="emptyCopy">Once connected, every non-empty worksheet tab will appear here as a day section. New daily tabs will load automatically when you refresh.</p>
            <div class="empty-actions">
              <button class="button-primary" id="connectEmptyButton" type="button">Connect Google Sheet</button>
              <a class="button-secondary" href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1XAyrsD9GLGaY3ZnaiWnND25iF3DsvKR_rhKFXkcffmQ/edit?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open source sheet ↗</a>
            </div>
            <p class="empty-message hidden" id="emptyMessage"></p>
          </div>
          <div id="daysContainer"></div>
          <div class="empty-state hidden" id="noResults">
            <h2>No matching entries</h2>
            <p>Try another date or search term.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <details class="setup-panel" id="connection">
          <summary>One-time Google Sheet connection setup</summary>
          <ol>
            <li>Open the linked spreadsheet and choose <code>Extensions → Apps Script</code>.</li>
            <li>Replace the editor contents with the companion <code>Code.gs</code> connector file.</li>
            <li>Choose <code>Deploy → New deployment → Web app</code>. Set access to the audience that is allowed to see this log, then deploy and copy the web app URL ending in <code>/exec</code>.</li>
            <li>Choose <strong>Connect Google Sheet</strong> above and paste that URL. The page will then load every non-empty tab and remember the endpoint in this browser. To make a shared GitHub Pages version load for all visitors, set <code>DEFAULT_ENDPOINT</code> near the top of the page script after deciding who is allowed to access the data.</li>
          </ol>
        </details>
        <footer class="footer">
          <span>Daily log view · KREJUV FEC Blowdown Tie-In</span>
          <span>Source: <a href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1XAyrsD9GLGaY3ZnaiWnND25iF3DsvKR_rhKFXkcffmQ/edit?usp=sharing" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Sheet</a></span>
        </footer>
